  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Norec, FK Norway, personnell exchange</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Solidarity Exchange for the Environment and Development (SEED) project will enable the exchange of young people to improve their knowledge about climate justice in practice, as well as their capacity to influence policymakers and communicate their knowledge to youth in Norway and Malawi. The project will also increase awareness and knowledge of climate justice in NfYD and Spire which again will be disseminated further to the respective target audiences and groups.</narrative>
  </description>
